7. Biggest Realization

Hindi lahat ng Index Scan ay mabilis.

Kapag milyon-milyon ang matching rows,

mahal pa rin ang execution.

Reason:

Index Scan pattern

Index

↓

Pointer

↓

Heap

↓

Pointer

↓

Heap

↓

Pointer

↓

Heap

Millions of pointer lookups become expensive.

8. Bitmap Heap Scan Connection

Ito ang naging realization natin.

Kapag maraming matching rows,

ordinary Index Scan becomes expensive.

Possible solution ng planner:

Bitmap Heap Scan

Instead of

Index

↓

Heap

↓

Index

↓

Heap

↓

Index

↓

Heap

Planner first collects matching locations.

After that,

reads heap pages efficiently.

Mas organized.

Mas kaunting random access.

9. Three Questions Before Optimizing

Always ask:

How many rows exist?

How many rows will be returned?

Which scan has the lowest cost?

Hindi:

"May index ba?"

