11. Production Incident – Lock Investigation

Scenario:

Application freezes every 10–15 minutes.

CPU

✔ Normal

RAM

✔ Normal

Disk

✔ Normal

Queries

✔ Fast

Observation:

Problem is NOT slow execution.

Possible hypothesis:

Transactions are waiting for locks.

Important realization:

Lock Waiting ≠ Deadlock

Lock Waiting

Isang transaction ang may hawak ng lock.
Iba ay naghihintay.
Kapag nag-commit ang unang transaction, tuloy ang iba.

Deadlock

Dalawa o higit pang transactions ang naghihintayan.
Walang makakausad.
Kailangan nang mamagitan ang PostgreSQL at mag-rollback ng isa.
12. Biggest Mindset Improvement

Noong Day 1,

ang tanong ko ay:

"What scan is this?"

Ngayon,

ang tanong ko ay:

"Why did PostgreSQL choose this scan?"

Hindi na ako naghahanap ng tamang scan.

Hinahanap ko na ang pinakamababang execution cost.
